-down catch, Vikings' OT win\" . ESPN.com . November 13, 2022 . Retrieved November 14, 2022 . ^ Nelson, Joe (November 14, 2022). \"Justin Jefferson's game in Buffalo is one of the best ever\" . Sports Illustrated . Retrieved November 15, 2022 . ^ Lawson-Freeman, Callie (November 16, 2022). \"Justin Jefferson's Week 10 catch was so amazing the Pro Football Hall of Fame wants a piece of it\" . Yahoo! Sports . Retrieved November 18, 2022 . ^ \"2022 NFL Week 10 Leaders & Scores\" . Pro Football Reference . Retrieved June 2, 2023 . ^ \"New England Patriots at Minnesota Vikings \u2013 November 24th, 2022\" . Pro Football Reference . Retrieved November 29, 2022 . ^ Peters, Craig (November 24, 2022). \"Justin Jefferson Passes Randy Moss' NFL Record Yards in 1st 3 Seasons\" . www.vikings.com . Retrieved November 29, 2022 . ^ Forness, Tyler (December 1, 2022). \"Justin Jefferson wins NFC Offensive Player of the Month for November\" . Vikings Wire . Retrieved June 2, 2023 . ^ Gates, Christopher (December 11, 2022). \"Justin Jefferson sets Vikings' regular season single-game receiving yards record\" . Daily Norseman . Retrieved June 2, 2023 . ^ Nelson, Joe (December 11, 2022). \"Failure to clinch: Lions the latest to carve up Vikings defense\" . Sports Illustrated . Retrieved December 11, 2022 . ^ Bates, Daniel (January 1, 2023). \"NFL World Reacts To Justin Jefferson, Referee Incident\" . The Spun: What's Trending In The Sports World Today . Retrieved January 10, 2023 . ^ Ragatz, Will (January 1, 2023). \"Justin Jefferson held to career-low one catch against Jaire Alexander, Packers\" . Sports Illustrated . Retrieved January 10, 2023 . ^ Junda, Zach (January 13, 2023). \"NFLSU: Justin Jefferson Named First-Team All-Pro\" . And The Valley Shook . SB Nation . Retrieved June 2, 2023 . ^ \"2022 Pro Bowlers\" . Pro Football Reference . Retrieved June 2, 2023 . ^ \"Justin Jefferson 2022 Game Log\" . Pro Football Reference . Retrieved June 2, 2023 . ^ \"Sporting News NFL awards\" . T