ge 3 \u2013 The Akron Beacon Journal\" . Newspapers.com . Archived from the original on June 2, 2016 . Retrieved May 3, 2016 . 1 2 \"28 Apr 1985, Page 59 \u2013 The Index-Journal\" . Newspapers.com . Archived from the original on August 4, 2016 . Retrieved May 3, 2016 . \u2191 \"Network New Zealand\" . NZ On Screen . 1985 . Retrieved October 11, 2021 . \u2191 \"Enos\" . Epguides.com . Retrieved January 16, 2023 . \u2191 \"East & Down's Jody Hill May Reboot Dukes of Hazard At Warner Bros\" . CinemaBlend. May 2, 2012. Archived from the original on May 5, 2018 . Retrieved May 5, 2018 . \u2191 \"The Dukes of Hazzard DVD news: Announcement for The Dukes of Hazzard \u2013 2 TV Movie Collection\" . TVShowsOnDVD. Archived from the original on October 7, 2010 . Retrieved April 27, 2010 . \u2191 \"The Dukes of Hazzard \u2013 Get Them Good Ol' Boys in 'The Complete Collection' 40-DVD package from Warner will hit the street in the U.S. this November\" . TVShowsOnDVD. Archived from the original on September 20, 2017 . Retrieved September 19, 2017 . \u2191 Source: The Dukes of Hazzard: The Complete Fourth Season DVD box set \u2191 \"Dukes of Hazzard Season 1: Philip Mandelker\" . Amazon . Archived from the original on May 9, 2016 . Retrieved September 15, 2017 . \u2191 Shales, Tom (January 26, 1979). \"The Dukes of Hazzard\" . The Washington Post . Retrieved December 8, 2020 . \u2191 Hartlaub, Peter (June 27, 2004). \"The Dukes of Hazzard: Complete First Season\" . San Francisco Chronicle . Retrieved December 8, 2020 . \u2191 Graydon, Danny (August 4, 2005). \"Dukes Of Hazzard: Season 1, The Review\" . Empire . Retrieved December 8, 2020 . \u2191 Kelly Souders & Brian Peterson (writers); Jeannot Szwarc (director) (November 3, 2005). \"Exposed\". Smallville . Season 5. Episode 6. The WB . \u2191 Sloan, Sam (November 3, 2005). \" 'The Dukes' of Smallville are on Tonight\" . Slice of SciFi . Archived from the original on June 5, 2011 . Retrieved June 6, 2011 . \u2191 \"Dictionary.co