m definition 'jorts' \" . May 29, 2018 . Retrieved September 28, 2020 . \u2191 \"Lizard Lick's most ridiculous repos | Lizard Lick Towing\" . Dave Channel . Retrieved November 2, 2018 . \u2191 \"The Dukes of Hazzard Ride Again in AutoTrader's High-Octane Campaign\" . AdWeek . June 24, 2014. Archived from the original on September 1, 2017 . Retrieved August 31, 2017 . \u2191 \"Amazon considers removing 'Dukes of Hazzard' from its streaming library over Confederate flag: report\" . Fox News . June 12, 2020. Archived from the original on June 30, 2020 . Retrieved July 11, 2020 . \u2191 \"Confederate flag gets 'Dukes of Hazzard' yanked\" . USA Today . July 1, 2015. Archived from the original on July 11, 2017 . Retrieved September 15, 2017 . \u2191 \"Amazon Considers Pulling 'Dukes of Hazzard' From Video Service\" . Bloomberg.com . June 12, 2020. Archived from the original on July 5, 2020 . Retrieved July 11, 2020 . Further reading [ edit ] Redneck Boy in the Promised Land: The Confessions of \"Crazy Cooter\" , by Ben \"Cooter\" Jones , 2008. Crown. ISBN 0307395278 External links [ edit ] Wikimedia Commons has media related to The Dukes of Hazzard . Wikiquote has quotations related to The Dukes of Hazzard . The Dukes of Hazzard official Facebook page Dukes of Hazzard at IMDb The Dukes of Hazzard at CMT Who sang the theme song and also served as the narrator on The Dukes of Hazzard? Archived February 28, 2018, at the Wayback Machine v t e The Dukes of Hazzard Episodes Characters Bo Duke Luke Duke Daisy Duke Sheriff Rosco P. Coltrane Boss Hogg Television films Reunion! (1997) Hazzard in Hollywood (2000) Remake films The Dukes of Hazzard (2005) soundtrack The Beginning (2007) Video games The Dukes of Hazzard Racing for Home Daisy Dukes It Out Return of the General Lee Hazard Run Spin-offs Enos The Dukes Related articles The General Lee Boar's Nest Jerry Rushing \" Theme from The Dukes of Hazzard (Good Ol' Boys) \" Moonrunners Authority control databases International VIAF N